{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "context-bounds-hold-projection-paging-allow-row-compaction",
  "title": "Context bounds hold: projection, paging, allow row, compaction",
  "requirement": "The model's context stays bounded: an oversized result from a tool the profile lists arrives as a banner naming a readable full-text file (REQ-128, REQ-134), the workspace board is paged instead of dumped (REQ-129), the orchestrator allow row decides what per-agent kit plugins may register (REQ-130), and the compaction threshold is the per-window budget — about 500K tokens at a 1M window and at most 218K at 272K, never the old flat 136K (REQ-131).",
  "kind": "regression",
  "status": "verified",
  "source": "agent",
  "automated": true,
  "testPath": "scripts/context-bounds-proof.mjs",
  "runCommand": "node scripts/context-bounds-proof.mjs",
  "steps": [
    "read profile/cordis.patch.yml: the run-code-projection tool list, the orchestrator allow row, every compaction-basic block",
    "apply the real run-code-projection plugin with that list on a fake context: a task_list result above 8 KiB must project, the spill file must read back identical, task_get/skill/error results must stay whole",
    "apply the real taskboard plugin on a temporary workspace with 60 seeded tasks: page one must be 25 rows with counts and a next cursor, limit/offset and the status filter must work, chat scope keeps 50",
    "spawn scripts/tool-surface-proof.mjs: the kit plugins must register only through the parsed allow row",
    "assert compaction per block: the general blocks (9) give 0.5 of a 1M window (524 288) and 0.8 of a 272K window (217 600, above 136K); the one declared exception, preset-architect, gives exactly 136 000 at 272K (0.5) and is the only isolated block",
    "write CASE_SUMMARY metrics; exit 0 only when every row passed"
  ],
  "expected": "The driver exits 0 with every check PASS and a CASE_SUMMARY whose metrics satisfy the declared checks (failures 0, projectionAfter <= 6000, taskListChars <= 12000, compactionGeneral1M 480000..540000, compactionGeneral272K 136001..218000, compactionIsolated272K == 136000, isolatedBlocks == 1). CASE_NEGATIVE_CONTROL=pre-change exits 1 because the same checks reject the one-tool projection list, the whole-board page, the old allow row and the flat 0.5 compaction in the general blocks.",
  "fixture": "profile/cordis.patch.yml read-only; a temporary workspace with .dsh/taskboard.json of 60 tasks, created and removed by the driver",
  "tags": [
    "context-bounds",
    "projection",
    "taskboard",
    "allow-row",
    "compaction",
    "proof"
  ],
